    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Score handedness of a designated parastichy family in large species-stratified cone image samples and test frequencies against 0.5, including a replication of the Norway spruce 5/8 class. Strong balanced frequencies support the claim; consistent directional bias refutes it.";
